# NOTICE — Illustration Neural Mesh Pack

This directory is an **opt-in** Model Pack for Akasha OS Illustration Studio.
It does **not** ship multi‑GB GGUF weights in the akasha-os git tree.

## Upstream licenses (when you install weights / runners)

| Component | Typical license | Notes |
|-----------|-----------------|-------|
| Microsoft TRELLIS / TRELLIS.2 model weights | MIT | LocalAI-io / ilintar GGUF conversions of Microsoft weights |
| DINOv3 GGUF companion | Meta DINOv3 License (not MIT) | Required by TRELLIS.2 image encoder path — inventory before redistribution |
| trellis.cpp / LocalAI trellis2cpp | See upstream repos | Prebuilt runners preferred for Preview |

## Akasha host

Akasha host crates (`crates/**`) and guest modules (`modules/**`) remain free of
neural mesh weights and do not link PyTorch / ggml at compile time for this path.
Generation is process-isolated (see README).

## Fixture

`fixtures/unit_cube.glb` is a tiny synthetic mesh for CI / mock mode only.
It is **not** TRELLIS output and carries no model weights.
